      "created_at": "2014-03-24T13:29:46.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm guessing its because GtG is composed of a very small team that usually works late hours designing and testing. &nbsp;As a playtester, I can tell you that they worked like mad things on GSF, and then started immediately working like mad things on tactics.</p><p>I can get the frustration, and I'm not trying to dismiss what you are saying. &nbsp;But they are really working hard, and I can tell you first hand that they care very much about it. &nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
