      "created_at": "2014-03-24T13:44:10.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>They know that information on GSF has lacked on their part. But the reality for them as Braith pointed out, as a very small team, some things lack so other things can get done.</p><p>As far as I know, GSF has been complete for a little while now and is most likely either at the printers as we speak or is on its way back to &gt;G (thats totally my guess and *not* official in any capacity).</p><p>I do know that almost certainly GSF will be avaliable in its full glory at PAX East wich starts April 11th. So with knowing that, KS backers should have their stuff soon?&nbsp;</p>",
