      "raw": "<p>So far they have not disappointed product-wise in any way. &nbsp;I trust they will let us know when it has moved to almost available, as Kickstarter backers will at that point start receiving copies. &nbsp;But between now and then we need to be patient and don&#39;t let the little things get to us.</p>",
